---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const description =
  'Privacy policy for Click Action AI Review. What this site collects, what JVZoo collects when you click an offer link, and how bonus emails are used.';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={description} canonicalURL="/privacy-policy">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <Breadcrumbs
        items={[
          { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
          { label: 'Privacy policy', href: '/privacy-policy' },
        ]}
      />
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated October 23, 2026. This policy covers clickactionai.info.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        Click Action AI Review publishes independent reviews and comparison pages. The contact address for this site is bonuses@clickactionaireview.com.
      </p>
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        The pages are static. There is no account, no checkout on this domain, and no analytics product installed on the site as of this update. We do not run a cookie banner because this site does not set advertising or analytics cookies of its own.
      </p>
      <p class="section-copy">
        The company that hosts the site may keep ordinary server logs, such as IP address, browser type, and the page requested, to operate and secure the server. We do not use those logs to build marketing profiles.
      </p>
      <h2>Affiliate links and JVZoo</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        Green buttons and other offer links leave this site and open a JVZoo checkout. JVZoo, and the vendor, then process your payment under their own privacy policy. They may set their own cookies to record that the visit came from this review. We do not receive your card number.
      </p>
      <h2>Email you send us</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        If you email bonuses@clickactionaireview.com, we use the message and the receipt to check that the purchase came through this site and to send the bonus files. We do not sell that email address or add it to a newsletter from the receipt alone.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        Your browser may store cookies set by JVZoo after you click an offer link. Those cookies are not set by the review pages themselves. You can block or delete cookies in your browser. Blocking them can affect how an affiliate platform attributes a sale. It does not change the price on the checkout.
      </p>
      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        This site is written for adults buying business software. It is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.
      </p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        If we add analytics or a form later, this page will be updated before that collection starts. The date at the top is the date of the current version.
      </p>
      <p class="section-copy">
        <a class="text-link" href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate disclosure</a>
        {' · '}
        <a class="text-link" href="/terms">Terms</a>
        {' · '}
        <a class="text-link" href="/">Back to the review</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
